{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14032","headline":"春日即事 · 耿湋","name":"春日即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳菲那变易，年鬓自蹉跎。\n室与千峯对，门唯二仲过。\n宦情知己少，生事托人多。\n草色微风长，莺声细雨和。\n几时犹滞拙，终日望恩波。\n纵欲论相报，无如漂母何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14032.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14032","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}